Give your phone's side keys and volume keys any function you want.

- Launch any app, Google Assistant or Google Wallet with a key press
- Separate actions for single press, double press and long press
- Scroll up and down in any app
- System actions: Home, Back, Recents, screenshot, lock, flashlight, media
- Battery Saver on a key press — handy where the quick settings panel won't let
  you add tiles
- Per-app profiles: different actions while a chosen app is in the foreground
- Charge alarm at a level you pick
- Built for E-Ink: pure black and white, no animations, key debounce
